      "why": "a method leaf for Workspace evidence: the pack has no reader for token, Drive or admin events, so it reads the export as supplied and names no tool or program"
    },
    {
      "path": "skills/logs/exported-evidence.md",
      "why": "a method leaf about what an exported file is before its records are read; it applies to every provider, names the base pack's check_inputs and the pack's inventory recipe, and no tool of its own"
    },
    {
      "path": "skills/logs/what-exists.md",
      "why": "a method leaf about what a supplied export covers and what its silence can say; it applies to every provider and sends the agent to the provider's own skill for any tool"
    }
  ],
